{"c":[{"name":"20261003T221243Z-e77935deee83e487","text":"Skills (B19): undoing a skill run resets its clean count, so a fixture forced-mismatch run with no Tab needs ten more clean runs after run 11's undo. Live Jev's first naming ask fell under NAME_CUTOFF 0.5 in 7 of 9 tries; the reworded retry picked.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T223314Z-4eadad36fdc3c539","text":"planRequest.windowId is the reader's '<pid>-<n>' id, which the host never learns for an arbitrary window; the host sends none until the helper's schema takes pid + window number (A14).","type":"note"}]}
